  "prefLabel": "Un 811.09 Waiver",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Un 811.09 Waiver. Nothing contained in these rules shall preclude the dean or director of admissions or campus residency officer from waiving any requirements hereof under special circumstances in individual cases. Waivers shall not be routinely granted.\n\nSource. #2701, eff 5-4-84; ss by #5449, eff 8-25-92, EXPIRED: 8-25-98\n\nNew. #8205, eff 11-17-04, EXPIRED: 11-17-12",
